# The Pullfrog workflow is generated and carries a do-not-edit header, so it
# is not ours to reformat. The formatter only unwraps a few long lines, which
# is harmless in itself, but the generator rewrites the file on every update
# and the difference would come back each time, failing the quality gate for a
# change nobody made. Ignoring it keeps the gate about our own code.
.github/workflows/pullfrog.yml
